          "tone": 1,
          "block": "spya-s7uc4u"
        },
        {
          "kind": "node",
          "id": "e2",
          "shape": "box",
          "x": 260,
          "y": 130,
          "w": 260,
          "h": 70,
          "text": "Among thousands of correct machines, first bugs come at varied, sometimes large n",
